# cloud-spires-game-over: the game-over reload. The game-over image is read
# through the synchronous reader with loadStage already 2; deferring that
# read's completion hangs the reader's no-VSync spin (watchdog exit at VBL
# 5916). 5973 is the game-over screen, 7873 the reloaded level live. 5940,
# 6020 and 6100 follow the player across the game-over picture: entering
# from the left, over the tower, and at rest on the wall ledge; the game
# draws the picture under the player.
cloud-spires-game-over|5973|1000||5940,5973,6020,6100,7873
#
# s3-create-save: a new game on a blank card in slot 1 (provisioned formatted
# by the binary in the leg's directory) creates and writes its save. 1678 and
# 2341 are presents where the game draws nothing: the display shows the last
# image drawn into the buffer it shows, the world under the card dialogue.
s3-create-save|1678|663||1678,2341|--card1 {legdir}/card1.mcr --no-card2

# spooky-swamp-area-1-respawn-clear: the respawn fade (game.state 3) ends at
# a subtraction of 240, then each tick DrawOTags an empty OT into a buffer
# whose DRAWENV auto-clears to black. 2900 and 3000 show the cleared buffer,
# where the area's last scene showed under its kept fade before.
spooky-swamp-area-1-respawn-clear|2900|100||2900,3000

# sunrise_spring-load-exit: the level-load exit after the loading screen's
# fade to black. The game puts DRAWENV 0,12 with isbg (8,8,8) under a
# subtractive fade of 255 and draws an empty OT, then shows that buffer;
# next it fills buffer 0,240 with the level's clear (82,186,68) and draws an
# empty OT, ClearImages both buffers black, and only then shows 0,240. The
# PSX shows black throughout; 1571 and 1572 are sub-tick presents of the
# empty scene, which composed the buffer it shows as the level's clear. The
# 1569 capture takes the canonical capture of the 0,12 draw, which a live
# present takes every tick. Blessed pre-fix.
sunrise_spring-load-exit|1569|4||1569,1571,1572|--skip-to-level sunrise_spring

# credits-cheat: the pause-menu credits cheat from Sunrise Spring. The credits
# overlay emits one subtractive full-width quad of grey D_8006C598 << 4 per
# tick while D_8006C598 != 0: the fade-in from black at VBL 2013-2043 and the
# fade through black at each scene change (3695-3757). 2025, 3708 and 3720
# are fade presents; 3690 precedes the fade. 2256 and 2600 are sub-tick
# presents with credits letters flying in and departing: the draw compacts
# the CreditsLetter records in states 1-3 into consecutive moby slots, so a
# departing or reused record moves every later letter to another slot.
credits-cheat|2013|200||2025,2256,2600,3690,3708,3720
# big-head-cheat: the pause-menu big head cheat from Sunrise Spring (Up R1
# x3, Circle x4; paused at VBL 1850, code entered 1900-1993, unpaused 2050)
# sets g_CheatFlags+6; the player draw scales the head matrix by the vector
# at g_CheatFlags+8 (0x2000 each, 2.0) (spyrodraw.s 0x8003D288).
big-head-cheat|2200|100||2100,2200
# flat-cheat: the pause-menu flat cheat from Sunrise Spring (Left Right Left
# Right L1 R1 L1 R1 Square Circle) sets g_CheatFlags+7; the player draw scales
# the body matrix's first column by 0x200 (spyrodraw.s 0x8003D1AC).
flat-cheat|2200|100||2100,2200
#
# sunny-villa-level-entry: the level entry from Sunrise Spring into Sunny
# Villa, ending on the loading screen's treasure tally (VBL ~4240-4720; the
# gems fly 4320-4470). The movie ends at 3949 and the row samples the game
# running on without input. In builder state 3 (D_8006FBC8) the loading
# overlay rebuilds the moby array every tick: one class-1 moby per active
# tally record (*D_8006C764, stride 8, active byte +4), then the counter gem
# (+0x0C 0x154, +0x14 0xC00), then the total gem (+0x0C 0xB4). 4370 and 4430
# are sub-tick presents with gems in flight: a spawn or a landing moves every
# later gem to another slot.
sunny-villa-level-entry|4300|200||4370,4430
# Cutscene letterbox bars growing 2 PSX rows per tick (VBL 1605-1627): the
# intermediate leg must show them between the two ticks. Blessed pre-fix.
agent_9s_lab-letterbox|1605|2||1607,1617|--skip-to-level agent_9s_lab
# @res1, @res2vp: the letterbox bars drawn into a --resolution 1 and 2 base
# (512x216 and 1024x432 at 4:3, widened at 16:9), resampled to the capture;
# @res2vp with integer vertex precision, whose implicit pixelation is inert
# under N.
agent_9s_lab-letterbox@res1|1605|2||1607,1617|--skip-to-level agent_9s_lab --resolution 1
agent_9s_lab-letterbox@res2vp|1605|2||1607,1617|--skip-to-level agent_9s_lab --resolution 2 --vertex-precision integer
# spooky-swamp-mole-glow-edge: Spooky Swamp sub-area 2 under a fixed freecam
# pose (engaged at VBL 2600). At VBL 2800 the left mole's lamp glow centre is
# at x -32 of the 512-wide frame, inside the 16:9 left band; the glow routine's
# lateral cull (the 4:3 frame plus a fixed margin, mobyfunc.s 8002EE58) drops
# the record and the native fan was absent from VBL ~2765. The movie is the
# first 2800 VBLs of a Cross-every-20-VBLs movie. Blessed pre-fix.
spooky-swamp-mole-glow-edge|2800|2||2800|OPENPETE_FREECAM_AT_VBL=2600 OPENPETE_FREECAM_POSE=68908,122952,5424,624,17,9
# dino-mines-dino-reveal: Dino Mines sub-area 3 under a freecam path (engaged
# at VBL 2600, one pose per tick). At VBL 2915 a dinosaur beyond the stock draw
# distance passes the game's cull box, which rounds the camera-relative delta
# as (cam - pos) >> 2 on Y and Z; the extended-LOD reveal's mirror rounded
# -((pos - cam) >> 2) and dropped it for one tick. The movie is the first 2930
# VBLs of a Cross-every-20-VBLs movie. Blessed pre-fix.
dino-mines-dino-reveal|2920|2||2909,2915|OPENPETE_FREECAM_AT_VBL=2600 --freecam-path @games/spyro-3/corpus/paths/dino-mines-dino-reveal.path
# sheilas-alp-glint-flash: Sheila's Alp under a freecam path (engaged at VBL
# 2064, one pose per tick) with every moby updating (OPENPETE_D1=1), so far gems
# spawn glints. OPENPETE_VIDEO_ZOE_NEAR=1 (the checkpoint fairy held near, a
# gameplay change) brings the far gems into the cross path; without it VBL 2377
# draws no stray cross. At 2377 five far gem crosses drew raw for one present,
# through walls, on both LOD legs: the near/far verdict, taken on fractional
# MACs, disagreed with the routine's on its floored integer MACs. 2379 is the
# next tick, which draws no stray cross. The movie is the first 2400 VBLs of a
# Cross-every-20-VBLs movie. Blessed pre-fix.
sheilas-alp-glint-flash|2377|600||2377,2379|OPENPETE_D1=1 OPENPETE_VIDEO_ZOE_NEAR=1 OPENPETE_FREECAM_AT_VBL=2064 --freecam-path @games/spyro-3/corpus/paths/sheilas-alp-glint-flash.path
# seashell-shore-rhynoc-barrel-key: Seashell Shore under a fixed freecam pose
# (engaged at VBL 2600), the barrel-lifting Rhynocs (class 0x101) and their
# barrels (class 0x166, a moby of its own). The barrel's m_DepthOffset keys it
# about 500 world in front of its true depth, so a barrel 64-400 world behind a
# Rhynoc's hand and head painted over them. The movie is the first 2929 VBLs of
# a Cross-every-20-VBLs movie. Blessed pre-fix.
seashell-shore-rhynoc-barrel-key|2929|2||2929|OPENPETE_FREECAM_AT_VBL=2600 OPENPETE_FREECAM_POSE=111992,56040,23420,569,-1,-14
# haunted-tomb-coffin-pillar: Haunted Tomb coffins (class 0x1db) beside the
# pillars, fixed freecam pose engaged at VBL 2600. Each coffin stands 1,100 or
# more world in front of the pillar base it covers. The movie is the first
# 2717 VBLs of a Cross-every-20-VBLs movie.
haunted-tomb-coffin-pillar|2717|2||2717|OPENPETE_FREECAM_AT_VBL=2600 OPENPETE_FREECAM_POSE=46484,30528,17464,60,6,0
# haunted-tomb-sunk-sphere: Haunted Tomb from --skip-to-level, fixed freecam
# pose engaged at VBL 1800, no movie. The class 0x22A sphere (m_DepthOffset 4)
# rests with about a third of its footprint behind the ground in true depth;
# the game inserts it four slots nearer and paints it whole over the ground,
# native cut its lower part along the true intersection. Blessed pre-fix.
haunted-tomb-sunk-sphere|1900|2||1900|--skip-to-level haunted_tomb OPENPETE_FREECAM_AT_VBL=1800 OPENPETE_FREECAM_POSE=86565,48496,14900,580,-2,0
# bamboo-terrace-stilts-hedge: Bamboo Terrace sub-area 1, fixed freecam pose
# engaged at VBL 2600. The bamboo stilts under the umbrella Rhynocs' huts are
# terrain and paint through the hedge-covered crest in front of them. The movie
# is the first 2829 VBLs of a Cross-every-20-VBLs movie. Blessed pre-fix.
bamboo-terrace-stilts-hedge|2829|2||2829|OPENPETE_FREECAM_AT_VBL=2600 OPENPETE_FREECAM_POSE=135376,96500,18404,807,0,-1
# sunrise-spring-surface-swim@glintstill: the camera held still from VBL 1845
# (scripted freecam engage at the follow camera's pose) with gem glints in
# view, near stars and far crosses (100-240 px painted at 1851-1861). The
# routine's truncations put each star corner 0-1.3 px off its exact position
# by an amount that changes every tick, so a spinning star's shape changes at
# each tick by more than its spin while the camera is still. Blessed pre-fix.
sunrise-spring-surface-swim@glintstill|1855|2||1855,1857|OPENPETE_FREECAM=1 OPENPETE_FREECAM_AT_VBL=1845
# settings-menu: the settings menu (OPENPETE_MENU_DEMO opens it at boot)
# drawn into the capture by --screenshot-overlays, over sunrise_spring. Its text is
# the credits font's glyph models, read from WAD.WAD on the disc
# (text_moby.c, GAME_FONT_WAD_MODEL).
settings-menu|2073|100||2073|--skip-to-level sunrise_spring OPENPETE_MENU_DEMO=1 --screenshot-overlays

